### OntoKSD – ABox: KnowledgeType Instances

@prefix knowledgetype: <http://purl.org/ontoksd/abox/knowledgetype#> .
@prefix ontoksd: <http://purl.org/ontoksd#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .

<http://purl.org/ontoksd/abox/knowledgetype>
    a owl:Ontology ;
    rdfs:label "OntoKSD KnowledgeType ABox"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "This ABox defines named individuals of the KnowledgeType class used by the OntoKSD ontology, aligned with the CC2020 classification of knowledge."@en  .

ontoksd:computing a ontoksd:KnowledgeType ;
    rdfs:label "Computing Knowledge"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Knowledge areas related to core technical concepts in computing."@en .

ontoksd:foundationalAndProfessional a ontoksd:KnowledgeType ;
    rdfs:label "Foundational and Professional Knowledge"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "General workplace-related knowledge such as communication, collaboration, and ethics. This knowledge deserves explicit attention in baccalaureate programs."@en .

ontoksd:domain a ontoksd:KnowledgeType ;
    rdfs:label "Domain Knowledge"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Knowledge related to the context or discipline in which computing is applied. This includes fields such as business, medicine, and engineering, or more specific domains like radiographic imaging or international currency exchange."@en .
